==English==
===Noun===
'''[[strange]] [[quark]]'''
#{{particles}} A quark having a [[fractional]] [[electric charge]] of -1/3 and a [[mass]] about 80 to 130 [[MeV]]. Symbol: s

====Translations====
*Finnish: [[outo-kvarkki]]
*Japanese: [[ストレンジクォーク]] (sutorenji kwōku)
*Russian: {{t|ru|странный кварк|tr=stránnyj kvark|m}}
*Swedish: {{t|sv|särkvark|c}}

